{"id":"0f1e525f3e037509","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-symbol.md","title":"Symbol","display":"df-symbol — Symbol","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-symbol","aliases":["88-df-symbol"],"display":"df-symbol — Symbol","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-symbol"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-symbol</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symbol — Symbol"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (signature index)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N^+\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\)</span> (arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogSym}\">\\(\\mathrm{LogSym}\\)</span> (fixed logical-and-punctuation symbol set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_S\\)</span> (constant-symbol set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-ary function-symbol set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-ary relation-symbol set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-nonlogical-symbol set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sym}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sym}_S\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-symbol set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symbol} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Const}_S\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symbol} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Const}_S\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symbol} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sym}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cup\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symbol} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sym}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cup\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号说明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>符号是字母表的组成元素</li>\n<li>符号本身没有内在含义，其意义通过语义解释赋予</li>\n<li>非逻辑符号按常量、各元函数和各元关系分类，并由签名<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>确定；\n各分量的互斥性由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a>的签名良构条件保证</li>\n</ul>\n<p>逻辑符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>联结词：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span>（否定）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span>（合取）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span>（析取）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rightarrow\">\\(\\rightarrow\\)</span>（蕴涵）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\leftrightarrow\\)</span>（等值）</li>\n<li>量词：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\">\\(\\forall\\)</span>（全称）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\">\\(\\exists\\)</span>（存在）</li>\n<li>等号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span></li>\n<li>辅助符号：括号、逗号</li>\n</ul>\n<p>非逻辑符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>常量符号：如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0, 1, a, b\">\\(0, 1, a, b\\)</span></li>\n<li>函数符号：如对象语言中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf s,+,\\times,f,g\">\\(\\mathsf s,+,\\times,f,g\\)</span></li>\n<li>谓词符号：如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;, \\leq, P, Q\">\\(&lt;, \\leq, P, Q\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1ac75150a2814e24\" href=\"?note=1ac75150a2814e24\" title=\"88-df-alphabet\">88-df-alphabet</a>：通用的有限非空字母表</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>：符号按规则组合形成的表达式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>：由函数符号和常量符号构成的表达式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"非逻辑符号按常量、各元函数和各元关系分类，并由签名$S$确定；\n各分量的互斥性由[[88-df-language]]的签名良构条件保证","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"1ac75150a2814e24","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-alphabet]]：通用的有限非空字母表","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]：符号按规则组合形成的表达式","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]：由函数符号和常量符号构成的表达式","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogSym}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Func}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NLSym}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sym}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symbol} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{NLSym}_S\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Const}_S\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Func}_S^n\n\\cup\\bigcup_{n\\geq1}\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symbol} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sym}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{LogSym}\\cup\\mathrm{NLSym}_S","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg","display":false},{"tex":"\\land","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor","display":false},{"tex":"\\rightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"=","display":false},{"tex":"0, 1, a, b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf s,+,\\times,f,g","display":false},{"tex":"<, \\leq, P, Q","display":false}],"bytes":1747,"backlinks":[{"id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9df3c26c280af75a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$ ($n$-ary relation-symbol set, see [[88-df-symbol]])"},{"id":"19f597e8b5469bbc","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ (symbol set, see [[88-df-symbol]])"},{"id":"6967b79fb2644c98","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$c^{\\mathcal{M}}$ : 常量$c$的解释 (see [[88-df-symbol]])"},{"id":"03af5095ed087251","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L^+$ 是下述加入该函数的签名；签名分量见 [[88-df-symbol]]。扩张沿用原变量字母表（同下标变